Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:59:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/26] A-VPN core patches

Keep route rules from the start config ahead of the built-in ones (home
WireGuard network, Server mode), and expose the URL test timeout as
url-test-timeout.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
